      "web_template": "Grants program section",
      "web_template_values": "{\"heading\":\"The Grants Program\",\"subtext\":\"The grants program was initiated with the vision to provide financial support to FOSS projects and events across the country. \\n<br/><br/>\\nIf you have a FOSS specific project or initiative and in need of monetary support, you can start a conversation with us at <a style=\\\"font-weight: semi-bold; color: #08B74F\\\" href=\\\"mailto:grants@fossunited.org\\\">grants@fossunited.org</a>. \\n<br/>\\nWe fund FOSS projects by raising funds from the tech industry, either through our <a  style=\\\"font-weight: semi-bold; color: #08B74F\\\" href='https://fossunited.org/industry-partners'>Industry Partnership Program</a> or by reaching out to them upon receiving requests from FOSS projects/organizations.\\n<br><br>\\nOur grants program also provide financial support to FOSS events. To avail an event grant, <a style=\\\"font-weight: semi-bold; color: #08B74F\\\" href=\\\"mailto:grants@fossunited.org\\\">write to us</a> with a proposal on the event specifics like goals, target audience, support links and documents etc.\"}",
